X-SOURCE-ID:browncounty
SUMMARY:Squash the Block
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T220000
DTSTAMP:20260527T143803Z
UID:MEC-be8978111677d56a1915e02196685d7b@browncounty.com__20261031
SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 05/Trick-or-Treat.jpg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Family Friendly,Food &amp\; Drink,Free,Happening,
 Holiday,Outdoor Adventure
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260527
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Halloween in the heart of Nashville during the annua
 l Squash the Block community trick-or-treat event! Families\, kids\, and v
 isitors are invited to dress in costume and explore downtown Nashville whi
 le collecting candy and treats from participating local businesses.\nThis 
 festive evening features safe\, family-friendly fun throughout town\, incl
 uding themed activities\, costumed volunteers\, and stops along the Salt C
 reek Trail. From candy stations and photo opportunities to community event
 s like the Alleyween Party\, Squash the Block brings the entire Brown Coun
 ty community together for a fun-filled Halloween tradition.\nGrab your cos
 tume\, bring your candy bag\, and enjoy an unforgettable evening of treats
 \, music\, games\, and hometown Halloween spirit in beautiful Brown County
 !\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260616
LOCATION:Nashville\, IN
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/squash-the-block/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
