 e? Which one tells the best story? Or invent an award of your own. Hold yo
 ur trophy up (18 inches back from the art)\, snap a photo of your winner. 
 Receive a free art museum sticker for participating.</p><p class="p1">  Th
 e challenge runs across three floors. Self-guided\, family friendly\, and 
