 cluding your polling location and leads for transportation to cast your v
 otes. Refreshments\, music\, and fellowship are all a part of the occasio
 n! \n\nHosted by: Neal-Marshall Black Culture Center\n\nAdditional Inform
 ation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12933827
