CATEGORIES:Educational,Family Friendly,Free,Happening,Outdoor Adventure,Sp
 ecial Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260724
DESCRIPTION:The Friends of Brown County State Park is a not for profit org
 anization that fundraises for park infrastructure\, plans events\, and org
 anizes volunteer work. Come learn how you can be involved with Brown Count
 y State Park!\nThe meeting begins at 6:30pm at the Brown County State Park
  Nature Center. Meetings are the first Wednesday of every month.\nThe Frie
 nds help with the Wildflower Foray\, Rockfest\, Snakefest\, Halloween\, an
 d other events! Completed projects include the Friends Trail\, the Friends
 ’ Picnic Shelter near the Nature Center\, the restored Peach Tree Shelte
 r\, the pickel ball courts\, the flower gardens around the park\, and many
  other projects!\nGet involved now to help with the restoration of the Fir
 e Tower. The goal is to have the work done by the Brown County State Park 
 Centennial in 2029.\nLearn more about the Friends by coming to the meeting
  or visiting their website: https://www.friendsbcsp.org/ ( https://www.fr
 iendsbcsp.org/ )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811
LOCATION:1801 IN-46\, Nashville\, IN
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
