DESCRIPTION:Everyone has a network\, even if you don’t realize it! Thanksg
 iving break is coming up and it’s the perfect time to meet with old and n
 ew contacts. Whether you are updating your LinkedIn profile or deepening 
 your relationships with a relative\, family friend\, or neighbor while ta
 lking about their work\, Career Exploration & Student Employment can help
  you prepare for those professional connections.\nSwing by Wells 002 for 
 a pumpkin spice treat\, and the Career Peers will help you create a plan 
 to spice up your network! No appointment necessary! All students welcome.
 \nRegister through Handshake\n\nHosted by: Undergraduate Education\n\nAdd
 itional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event
 /12564162
