CATEGORIES:Student-run
DESCRIPTION:Join Marc Levin\, Chief Policy Counsel for the Council on Crim
 inal Justice and Senior Advisor for Right on Crime\, and the Federalist So
 ciety for a discussion of originalism in the courtroom\, exploring how his
 tory and constitutional interpretation inform modern criminal justice\, th
 e rights of defendants\, and the limits of government power.
