 or the Council on Criminal Justice and Senior Advisor for Right on Crime\,
  and the Federalist Society for a discussion of originalism in the courtro
 om\, exploring how history and constitutional interpretation inform modern
  criminal justice\, the rights of defendants\, and the limits of governmen
 t power.</p>
