DESCRIPTION:With the cold weather approaching\, the November First Thursd
 ays will bring its celebration of art\, ideas\, and community inside. The
  event will take place at several indoor spaces across campus\, including
  IU Auditorium https://www.iuauditorium.com/ \, Eskenazi Museum of Art ht
 tps://artmuseum.indiana.edu/ \, Grunwald Gallery https://eskenazi.indiana
 .edu/exhibitions/grunwald-gallery/index.html \, Lilly Library https://lib
 raries.indiana.edu/lilly-library \, Wells Library https://libraries.india
 na.edu/herman-b-wells-library \, Wylie House Museum https://libraries.ind
 iana.edu/wylie-house-museum \, McCalla https://collections.iu.edu/mccalla
 /visit.html \, and Ford-Crawford Hall https://music.indiana.edu/news-even
 ts/directions-parking/index.html . Each space will host its own lineup of
  activities and offer special giveaways. For the full list of locations\,
  activities\, and giveaway details\, please visit go.iu.edu/first-thursda
