CREATED:20260615
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for a weekend dedicated to self-care?  Join E
 mily in the charming small town of Nashville Indiana for a weekend yoga re
 treat November 6-8th!  It will be a beautiful weekend with the fall leave
 s changing.  The retreat is located at the Cornerstone Inn for two nights
  right in the heart of town\, everything is walkable.  The weekend will c
 onsist of yoga in the morning and evening at the Cornerstone Inn\, a craft
 \, optional activities\, shopping\, hiking in Brown County State Park\, wi
 ne tasting\, free time\, whatever you desire!  Emily’s classes are desi
 gned for all levels and beginners.\nThere is a yoga retreat fee that inclu
 des a Brown County goody bag for each guest\, a total of 4 yoga classes\, 
 dinner Friday evening\, breakfast each morning\, crafts\, wine\, snacks\, 
 and the rental of the community room for yoga.  Come alone or bring a fri
 end!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260615
LOCATION:54 Franklin Street Nashville Indiana
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/brown-county-weekend-yoga-retreat/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
