DESCRIPTION:An afternoon of pampering\, wellness\, and community at Sycamo
 re Farm\, hosted by Garnish Catering\, Sycamore Farm\, and Paragon Wellnes
 s.\n\nRegistration: $10. A portion of each registration is donated to Moth
 er Hubbard's Cupboard.\nRegister: https://forms.gle/y5NHpbUWpXCPgCYG6\n\nW
 hat to expect:\n- Chair massages and hand massages\n- Aromatherapy bar\n- 
 Mimosa bar and hors d'oeuvres\n- Glow and Go facial bar and nail bar\n- Sp
 inal wellness screenings and a stretch and band station\n- Cryotherapy\, P
 EMF station\, and neurobiofeedback sessions\n- Zentangle sessions\n- Welln
 ess drinks and supplements\n- Clothing closet\, face and balloon art\, and
  a photo booth\n\nPrizes: Door prizes from vendors throughout the event. T
 he grand prize is a 4-hour party with appetizers from Garnish Catering for
  up to 50 people.\n\nExtra prize entries: register by October 31\, comment
  on\, like\, and share the event post\, and complete the passport at the e
 vent by visiting all stations.\n\nListed on BloomingtonOnline.com\, your c
 ommunity guide to Bloomington and Monroe County. Submit your event at http
 s://bloomingtononline.com/submit-an-event/
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T130446Z
LOCATION:Sycamore Farm\, 1700 W That Rd\, Bloomington\, IN 47403
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
