BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_48ac7e6a73bd950b28dea0eca41b3050858f0c4f00ddfbd78dd23a2a9e5fc51d
SUMMARY:Spiritual Formation Opportunity
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T111500
DTSTAMP:20261031T052108Z
UID:2e86unqfd64csopv3ltkknv591@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T101500
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261027T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">Spiritual Formation Opportunity </p><p dir="ltr"
 > </p><p dir="ltr">Would you like a chance to really deepen your spiritua
 l life and your relationship with God? Do you want to pray more regularly\
 , but could use some structure and accountability? If so\, you might be in
 terested in participating in a program of  guided personal prayer and sma
 ll group spiritual direction meetings\, grounded in the Spiritual Exercise
 s of St. Ignatius of Loyola (a rich\, centuries-old program of spiritual d
 evelopment). If you are at all curious about this\, please come to an info
 rmational meeting in the library on Sunday\, Nov 8\, between the 9:00 and 
 11:30 services\, to learn more. If you have any questions\, email Sheila T
