SUMMARY:Stine An Poetry Reading
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T190000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052103Z
UID:2l3o062jok09btd77b2vr3to0g@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T173000
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260813T140028Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a reading and conversation to celebrate the launch
  of poet and translator Stine An's explosive debut. B-Dragon Suite is a hy
 brid collection that remixes experimental translation\, sound art\, and em
 oji poetics to explore K-pop as both pleasure engine and cultural archive.
  Fabulated boy bands\, mistranslation\, code-switching\, diaspora as drag.
  How does language survive colonial history\, migration\, and spectacle? "
 A 21st-century Dictée." Stine will be joined by translator and scholar Cy
 nthia Shin.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261016T215028Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Redbud Books
END:VEVENT
