END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 237": "https://events.iu.edu/lgbtq/event/2376542-embedded-counseling"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_237
SUMMARY:Embedded Counseling (CAPS)
DTSTART:20261109T130000Z
DTEND:20261109T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260810T143143Z
UID:20261102T130000Z-2376542@events.iu.edu__20261109
DESCRIPTION:Supporting your well-being is an important part of our work at
  the LGBTQ+ Culture Center. That's why we are proud to partner with Counse
 ling &amp\; Psychological Services (CAPS) to provide an embedded counselor
  in our space every Monday from 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m.  Mollibeth Penner\,
  LHMCA serves as our embedded counselor and works directly with students c
 onnected to the LGBTQ+ Culture Center. To schedule an appointment\, please
  call CAPS (https://healthcenter.indiana.edu/make-appointment/index.html) 
 and let them know you are an LGBTQ+ Culture Center student interested in m
 eeting with Mollibeth at the center.      We hope this partnership makes i
 t easier for you to access support in a space where you feel comfortable a
 nd affirmed.  All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, educat
 ional\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all members of the I
