CATEGORIES:Social Event
DESCRIPTION:Are you building a legacy in your family? If so\, here's an op
 portunity to share a moment with like-minded individuals as we highlight 
 First-Generation College Students\, anyone who is limited income\, and an
 yone who is looking to build community. Come and share a moment with F.G.
 L.I.P. and F.Y.F.E.P. as we celebrate you and your family. Yes\, I did sa
 y family. Feel free to bring whoever you'd like to this event\, as your f
