DESCRIPTION: \nfxCampus gathers weekly on campus for Bible study\, fellows
 hip\, discussion\, worship\, community and prayer. These gatherings are o
 pen to all regardless of belief/background or previous knowledge of the B
 ible. This fall\, we will be studying the book of Acts.If you are interes
 ted in connecting with us\, please fill out our connection form.Have a pr
 ayer request? Submit it here\nLooking to get connected with a local churc
