SUMMARY:Brown County Art Guild 2026 Annual Raffle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261112T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261112T230000
DTSTAMP:20260417T142538Z
UID:MEC-d14387be71d9f4739f36dd3051dfb343@browncounty.com__20261112
