DESCRIPTION:Join us at the museum and mentally recenter by making art or j
 ournaling\, and make some time to check in with yourself!  Join us for a t
 herapist-selected art activity meant to help you feel more balanced and in
  control. No prior skills needed\, just bring your heart and mind.  This g
 roup meets Thursday from 2–3 p.m.\, excluding holidays and museum closur
 es. Meetings are held in the Atrium of the Sidney and Lois Eskenazi Museum
  of Art. Food and beverages are permitted in the atrium\, so participants 
 are welcome to bring lunch.
