DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe PNM Information Session is an opportunit
 y for potential new members to learn more about Indiana University Panhel
 lenic Recruitment and what to expect throughout the process. The session 
 will cover recruitment registration\, important dates and deadlines\, the
  PNM video submission\, recruitment rounds\, expectations\, and helpful t
 ips for navigating recruitment. PNMs will also have the opportunity to as
