DESCRIPTION:From Tudor Queens to Pop Icons\, the SIX wives of Henry VIII t
 ake the microphone to remix five hundred years of historical heartbreak in
 to a Euphoric Celebration of 21st century girl power! This new original mu
 sical is the global sensation that everyone is losing their head over! The
  New York Times says SIX TOTALLY RULES! \\(Critic's Pick\\) and The Washin
 gton Post hails SIX as Exactly the kind of energizing\, inspirational illu
 mination this town aches for! The SIX: LIVE ON OPENING NIGHT Broadway albu
 m debuted at Number 1 on the Billboard cast album charts and surpassed one
  billion streams worldwide!
LOCATION:Indiana University - Bloomington
