DESCRIPTION:If you've always felt like you didn't know how to look at art\
 , you've come to the right place\; bring your lunch and hop on Zoom as we 
 show you a tried-and-true method for looking at things.  On the second Mon
 day of each month\, join Eskenazi Museum of Art's resident Arts-based Well
 ness Experiences Manager Keaton Evans-Black to look at and talk about a pi
 ece of art from the IU museum collections using the see\, think\, wonder f
 ramework.  No previous art experience necessary! Meeting URL: https://iu.z
 oom.us/j/6082812369
