  Op. 13 (1945)<br /></em>Dring : <em>Trio (1968)<br /></em>Still: <em>Min
 iatures (1948)<br /></em>Gaubert: <em>Tarentelle (1903)<br /></em><br /><
 strong>About the Artist</strong><br /><br /><strong>Pei-San Chiu</strong>
  is an internationally acclaimed Taiwanese flutist and educator. She debu
