 \, cyanotype print and drawing\, 2026 (detail).
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>An exhibition by Miller Architecture Program Direct
 or and Associate Professor Daniel Luis Martinez at the Contemporary Art Mu
 seum of Indianapolis.</p>
