SUMMARY:Tusk: The Classic Fleetwood Mac Tribute
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T010000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T010000
DTSTAMP:20261029T125650Z
UID:MEC-3995be2905114e150e9a1645907ae652@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T010000
SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 10/2-300x240-3.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Live Music
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261029
DESCRIPTION:Playing the hits and deep cuts spanning the careers of Rock & 
 Roll Hall of Fame inductees Fleetwood Mac\, TUSK: The Classic Fleetwood Ma
 c Tribute returns to the Brown County Music Center in Nashville\, Ind.\, o
 n Friday\, November 20\, 2026.\nTUSK has been crisscrossing the country si
 nce 2008 as The Classic Fleetwood Mac Tribute. Five pro musicians turned i
 nto masters of their trade through decades of individual music study\, liv
 e performance\, creative risk\, and devotion to the art. TUSK features not
 e-perfect renditions of both the solo and full band songs\, with each memb
 er specializing in one of the core lineup of Fleetwood Mac (Lindsey Buckin
 gham\, Stevie Nicks\, Christine McVie\, John McVie\, and Mick Fleetwood). 
 They possess an electric stage presence that can only come from well over 
 a decade touring together. While exceptional musicianship\, authentic voca
 ls\, and meticulous attention to detail are essential\, what truly sets TU
 SK apart can’t be learned or manufactured.\nTruly the best at what they 
 do\, TUSK is unmatched in their tribute to one of the greatest bands of al
 l time.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029
LOCATION:200 Maple Leaf Boulevard\, Nashville\, IN 47448
ORGANIZER;CN="Brown County Music Center":MAILTO:boxoffice@browncountymusic
 center.com
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/tusk-the-classic-fleetwood-mac-tribute/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
