DESCRIPTION:A free\, all-ages cabaret night with ten 10-minute acts by loc
 al performers: music\, comedy\, dance\, storytelling\, magic\, juggling\, 
 puppetry\, poetry and more. The setting is informal\, friendly and non-com
 petitive\, with a quick pace that keeps things moving.\n\nWhen: Third Satu
 rday of each month\, 6 to 8 p.m.\nAdmission: Free\nAges: All ages welcome\
 nVenue: Bloomington Elks Lodge\, 400 N. Walnut St.\, downtown Bloomington\
 n\nThe organizers are also looking for performers of all kinds to fill fut
 ure lineups.\n\nListed by BloomingtonOnline.com\, Bloomington's community 
 events calendar.
