SUMMARY: Bingo Brunch at Cardinal Spirits
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Sunday 12-2pm at Cardinal Spirits for free Bing
 o Brunch with celebrity callers!\n\nThis week\, Charles Pearce of Pillar 
 Arts will join us to announce.\n\nWith awesome prizes up for grabs every 
 round and different local legends hosting each Sunday\, there’s no better
  way to keep the fun rolling on the weekends. Round up your crew and enjo
 y our full seasonal brunch menu with your favorite day drinks and delicio
 us dishes.\n\n  * Come and go as you need to!\n  * 21+\n  * Reservations 
 are welcome\n  * Celebrity callers are announced weekly!
