 elcome\, just avoid anything with fumes or loud noises.  Coloring books a
 vailable if your craft is on a time out. Bring your own snacks &amp\; dri
 nks or order delivery if you&#39\;re hungry.  Indoor and outdoor seating 
 available\, weather permitting. <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=htt
 ps://rebelpurl.com/pages/crafternoon-sunday-afternoons&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sour
 ce=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3ZZREJ9duuwqTMDsG1gOW4" target="_bla
 nk">https://rebelpurl.com/pages/crafternoon-sunday-afternoons</a></p>
