DESCRIPTION:Rainbow Connection offers a free\, confidential space for anyo
 ne under the LGBTQ+ umbrella to find community\, explore topics related to
  their identities\, learn about mental health topics\, or just have a week
 ly reset. This is a drop-in support group that does not require students t
 o sign up to participate.9/28 – "who I am" person drawing/talk about val
 ues and identity  10/5 – fall break intentions list/talk about self-care
  and goals  10/12 – mandalas/talk about mindfulness  10/19 - decorate a 
 "worth jar"/talk about gratitude and self-worth  10/26 – Winter Boos/ ta
 lk about self-care  11/2 – expressive art/talk about emotion regulation 
  11/9 – decorate tote bags  11/6 - stress balls/talk about stress manage
 ment  11/23 (Thanksgiving break) not meeting  11/30 – sensory jars/talk 
 about stress management and mindfulness  12/7 – coping toolboxAll Indian
 a University events\, groups\, activities\, educational\, cultural\, and h
 istorical observances welcome all members of the Indiana University commun
 ity.
