 ou manage stress during finals. Explore quick stress-relief activities\, 
 pick up helpful resources\, and create a take-home kit that supports your
  well-being. Whether you need a study break\, a moment to reset\, or a li
 ttle extra encouragement\, we've got you covered!\n\nHosted by: Health Pr
 omotion\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.ind
 iana.edu/event/12785058
