SUMMARY:Chris Isaak
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261216T003000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261216T003000
DTSTAMP:20261029T124446Z
UID:MEC-9879910650b0d80f3dadda2202c7fd8a@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261216T003000
SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 10/2-300x240-9.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Live Music
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261029
DESCRIPTION:Over the course of his three-decade plus career\, Platinum-sel
 ling and GRAMMY-nominated singer and actor Chris Isaak has performed to so
 ld-out crowds across the globe with his longtime band Silvertone. His musi
 c and film credits include thirteen critically acclaimed studio albums\, t
 welve chart-topping singles along with several motion pictures\, such as T
 he Silence of the Lambs and That Thing You Do!. His work has also taken hi
 m behind the scenes\, creating music for multiple film soundtracks\, inclu
 ding Eyes Wide Shut\, True Romance\, Wild at Heart\, and Blue Velvet. Isaa
 k has starred in his own critically acclaimed television series The Chris 
 Isaak Show on SHOWTIME\, has previously served as a judge on The X Factor 
 Australia\, and hosted the music talk show\, The Chris Isaak Hour on BIO. 
 2019 marked the 30th Anniversary of Isaak’s beloved Heart-Shaped World a
 lbum\, which includes his breakthrough classic “Wicked Game”. Isaak wa
 s recently honored with a Lifetime Achievement Award for Performance by th
 e Americana Honors.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029
LOCATION:200 Maple Leaf Boulevard\, Nashville\, IN 47448
ORGANIZER;CN="Brown County Music Center":MAILTO:boxoffice@browncountymusic
 center.com
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/chris-isaak/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
