SUMMARY:Happy Hour at Upland Brewing Co.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T170000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052006Z
UID:ej1k8s7qjugc4lsa110rgjjaes@google.com__20261217
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261022T212650Z
DESCRIPTION:Happy hour at Upland's Bloomington brewpub\, Monday to Friday 
 from 3 to 5 PM.\n\n$4 core beers: Dragonfly IPA\, Champagne Velvet\, Wheat
  Ale and Campside.\n\nFood:\n- Chicharrones with smoked chili seasoning\, 
 Bad Elmer's BBQ and lime ($5)\n- Sliders\, $4 each. Burgers: Classic\, Bad
  Elmer's Fav\, Blue Flame\, Inferno\, Beer Cheese or Sweet Plum. Sandwiche
 s: Local Pulled Pork\, Hoosier Tenderloin\, Turkey & Guac.\n- Mini brownie
  with whipped cream\, mint and Bad Elmer's caramel ($4)\n\nDaily beer spec
 ials ($5 pints\, $15 pitchers): Monday Dragonfly IPA\, Tuesday Champagne V
 elvet and CV Light\, Wednesday Wheat Ale\, Thursday Campside Pale Ale\, Fr
 iday rotating draft. Saturday is 20% off barrel-aged sour drafts\, and Sun
 day brings back the Monday to Thursday specials.\n\nTo go: crowlers of any
  core or specialty beer are $10\, or 3 for $25\, every day. Growlers are $
 2 off the Monday to Thursday specials on Wednesday and Sunday.\n\nSpecials
  from Upland's in-house menu as of October 2026 and may change. Check with
  Upland for current offerings.\n\nListed by BloomingtonOnline.com\, your c
 ommunity directory and local news hub for Bloomington and Monroe County.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T212653Z
LOCATION:Upland Brewing Co. Brewpub\, 350 W 11th St\, Bloomington\, IN 474
 04
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonOnline Food & Drink
END:VEVENT
