 gs.</p><p>  On the second Monday of each month\, join Eskenazi Museum of A
 rt's resident Arts-based Wellness Experiences Manager Keaton Evans-Black t
 o look at and talk about a piece of art from the IU museum collections usi
 ng the see\, think\, wonder framework.</p><p>  No previous art experience 
 necessary!</p> Meeting URL: https://iu.zoom.us/j/6082812369
