CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:Ever wanted to try your hand at pottery? Give it a spin…Come
  and try! We’ll show you the basics of how to throw on the wheel. You
 ’ll make a small bowl or cup and choose a glaze. Firing and finishing yo
 ur piece takes some time\, so your piece will be shipped to you after your
  visit. Bring a friend. Spots limited to 6 per time slot. Cost of this wor
 kshop includes instruction\, glaze\, firing and shipping. Ages 10+.\n
