BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"The Comedy Attic": "https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/385683", "Limestone Post": "https://www.comedyattic.com/events/142994"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"The Comedy Attic": "https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/385682"}
X-SOURCE-ID:comedy_attic
SUMMARY:New Year's Eve Starring Brent Terhune!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261231T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261231T220000
UID:20261231-new-year-s-eve-starring-brent-terhune-2000
DESCRIPTION:Spend the biggest night in comedy at one the top 5 comedy club
 s in the country! 10:30 show includes a champagne toast as we count down t
 o 2027! Brent Terhune is a nationally-touring stand-up comedian\, writer\,
  and podcaster. His comedy album\, Mr. Turkey\, went to #1 on iTunes. Bren
 t got his start in stand-up comedy in Indianapolis\, Indiana at the age of
  16. Most people would describe him as a white man\, but according to Bren
 t he “got the black knocked off of him at an early age when he refused t
 o clean up his room” and he is now doomed to walk the earth as a pale re
 dhead or as he likes to call himself a real “OG” or Original Ginger. N
 ot many comics can pull off Brent’s laid-back style of comedy and still 
 remain just as absurd\, relevant\, and funny as he is. Whether talking abo
 ut the everyday struggles of being a redhead\, life as a college student a
 nd radio DJ\, or his off-the-wall Uncle Frank and family\, Brent is sure t
 o keep you laughing well after he’s left the stage. Characters\, voices\
 , one liners\, and time-tested monologues - Brent Terhune is the embodimen
 t of all these things and more. Currently\, Brent is a writer for the nati
 onally syndicated Bob & Tom Radio Show (he’s been on the show\, too) as 
 well as the co-host of the immensely popular podcast that is enjoyed by do
 zens of listeners\, The Interweb Podshow. He’s the creator\, writer\, an
 d illustrator of the Uncle Frank comic strip and he’s performed at the I
 owa Comedy Festival\, Gilda’s Laugh Fest\, and the Cleveland Comedy Fest
 ival (runner up 2012)\, the Limestone Comedy Festival\, and the Laugh Your
  Ashville Off Comedy Festival.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/385682
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic, Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
