DESCRIPTION:The NAMI Greater Bloomington Area chapter hosts an in person N
 AMI Connection Support Group on the first and third Saturdays of each mont
 h from 10:30am-Noon at the Monroe County Public Library – Downtown Branc
 h (check at front desk for room number).NAMI Connection is a support group
  for adults living with mental health conditions. The group provides a str
 uctured atmosphere for struggling individuals to bring their problems and 
 obtain support from their peers. Meetings are led by NAMI-trained indi
LOCATION:First United Church\, 2420 East Third Street\, Bloomington
URL:https://namigreaterbloomingtonarea.org/event/nami-connection-support-g
 roup-in-person/2027-01-02/
