SUMMARY:Bike Project Open Hours
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270102T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270102T150000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052052Z
UID:kdmnorr2h678rac92atfs95030_R20200718T160000@google.com__20270102
SEQUENCE:2
CREATED:20081013T165354Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><b><i>The Community Bike Project is open with limited hour
 s on Saturdays. Hit up their FB page for more up to date info!</i></b><br>
 &nbsp\;The Community Bike Project is a Bloomington-based organization that
  focuses on providing bike transportation to the people of the city. We fo
 cus on teaching bicycle maintenence in order to ensure that bikes on the s
 treets stay on the streets. Here is what we do: Community Bike Project Fro
 nt Door<br><br><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;* bikes for sale: we sell gently
  used bikes at bargain prices<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* ear
 n-a-bike program: participants can receive a bicycle after volunteering th
 eir time in our shop<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* advocacy: we
  support alternative forms of transportation\; we support the reuse and re
 cycling of bicycles<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* workshops &am
 p\; classes: we offer unique bike maintence workshops and classes for chil
 dren and adults<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* open shop: we mak
 e our tools available to the public<br><br><br><a href="https://www.facebo
 ok.com/btownbikeproject/" id="ow664" __is_owner="true">FB PAGE</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051301Z
LOCATION:Community Bike Project
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Let's Go! Bloomington
END:VEVENT
