 chera)\n🍕 Mother Bear’s (Until 4 PM\, Dine-In) – Large slice-of-the
 -day + soft drink – $5.50\n🍕 Mother Bear’s (Lunch Specials) – Sel
 ect pizza/salad/breadstick combos – $7.95\n🍕 Mother Bear’s (Dine-In
 ) – Large specialty salad + free ½ breadsticks & soft drink\n🍷 Uptow
 n Cafe – ½ price bottles of wine\n🍹 Crazy Horse (All Day) – $3 sel
 ected spirits | $1 double-up | $5 Mules | 23oz drafts = pint price\n🍺 B
 rothers Bar & Grill (All Day) – $2 double wells | $3 domestic drafts | $
 5 32oz LIT pitchers | $8 domestic | $11 craft/import pitchers\n🍸 La Cha
 rreada – $2 off Brava Margaritas\n🌮 Social Cantina (Mon–Fri\, 11 AM
