DESCRIPTION:🍕 Bucceto's (Until 4 PM) – Big slice + garden salad + dre
 ssing + large drink – $8.25\n🍣 Fresh Thyme – $5 sushi rolls\n🏰 I
 MU Tudor Room (After 1 PM) – Student buffet lunch – $11.99 w/ Student 
 ID\n🍻 Kilroy's on Kirkwood – $3 double wells | $3 Miller Lite & Coors
  Light | $3 LI variations | $3 well shooters | $3 quesadillas | $3 appetiz
 ers | $6 flatbreads\n🌮 La Bodega – 3 tacos for $8.99 (Asada\, Chorizo
 \, Cabeza\, Rib Eye\, Tongue\, Arrachera)\n🥗 Le Petit Café – Lunch b
 uffet (salad bar\, pastries\, meat dish\, often quiche) – $7.95\n🍕 Mo
 ther Bear's (Until 4 PM\, Dine-In) – Large slice-of-the-day + soft drink
  – $5.50\n🍕 Mother Bear's (Lunch Specials) – Select pizza/salad/bre
 adstick combos – $7.50\n🍕 Mother Bear's (Dine-In) – Large specialty
  salad + free ½ breadsticks & soft drink\n🍺 Mother Bear's Thirsty Thur
 sday – Any pitcher – $10.95\n🍔 BuffaLouie's – $2 off burgers\n
 🍚 Ami – 15% off donburi bowls\n🍸 Crazy Horse – Thirsty Thursday:
  $4 Tito's | $5 martinis & Long Islands | $7 32oz Bud Light pitchers\n🍻
  Brothers Bar & Grill – Bingo 8:30–10:30 PM | $1 Cherry Bombs | $2 dou
 ble wells | $3 domestic & craft/import drafts | $3 Vegas Bombs & calls | $
 4 32oz OG LIT pitchers\n🌮 Social Cantina (Mon–Fri\, 11 AM–3 PM) –
  $12 lunch specials: tacos\, quesadilla\, or cantina salad + choice of sid
 e & soft drink\n🍺 The Tap – Daily specials on house-brewed pints\, co
 cktails & select spirits\n🍻 Yogi's – Daily drink specials (check in-s
 tore for Thursday options)\n🍕 Lennie's (4–6 PM) – $5 flatbreads + d
 aily drink specials\n🍔 Bru Burger (3-5:30 PM) – Happy Hour: ½ price 
 appetizers + $3 off draft beer\, cocktails & wine
