DESCRIPTION: The Community Bike Project is a Bloomington-based organizatio
 n that focuses on providing bike transportation to the people of the city.
  We focus on teaching bicycle maintenence in order to ensure that bikes on
  the streets stay on the streets. Here is what we do: Community Bike Proje
 ct Front Door\n<br><Br>\n\n\n    * bikes for sale: we sell gently used bik
 es at bargain prices\n<br>\n    * earn-a-bike program: participants can re
 ceive a bicycle after volunteering their time in our shop\n<br>\n    * adv
 ocacy: we support alternative forms of transportation\; we support the reu
 se and recycling of bicycles\n<Br>\n    * workshops & classes: we offer un
 ique bike maintence workshops and classes for children and adults\n<br>\n 
    * open shop: we make our tools available to the public\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051226Z
LOCATION:Community Bike Project
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Let's Go! Bloomington
