BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_j6botrehcce8vobqe6vpb4hnhk
SUMMARY:Happy Hour at Upland Brewing Co.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270112T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270112T170000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052006Z
UID:ej1k8s7qjugc4lsa110rgjjaes@google.com__20270112
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261022T212650Z
DESCRIPTION:Happy hour at Upland's Bloomington brewpub\, Monday to Friday 
 from 3 to 5 PM.\n\n$4 core beers: Dragonfly IPA\, Champagne Velvet\, Wheat
  Ale and Campside.\n\nFood:\n- Chicharrones with smoked chili seasoning\, 
 Bad Elmer's BBQ and lime ($5)\n- Sliders\, $4 each. Burgers: Classic\, Bad
  Elmer's Fav\, Blue Flame\, Inferno\, Beer Cheese or Sweet Plum. Sandwiche
 s: Local Pulled Pork\, Hoosier Tenderloin\, Turkey & Guac.\n- Mini brownie
  with whipped cream\, mint and Bad Elmer's caramel ($4)\n\nDaily beer spec
 ials ($5 pints\, $15 pitchers): Monday Dragonfly IPA\, Tuesday Champagne V
 elvet and CV Light\, Wednesday Wheat Ale\, Thursday Campside Pale Ale\, Fr
 iday rotating draft. Saturday is 20% off barrel-aged sour drafts\, and Sun
 day brings back the Monday to Thursday specials.\n\nTo go: crowlers of any
  core or specialty beer are $10\, or 3 for $25\, every day. Growlers are $
 2 off the Monday to Thursday specials on Wednesday and Sunday.\n\nSpecials
  from Upland's in-house menu as of October 2026 and may change. Check with
  Upland for current offerings.\n\nListed by BloomingtonOnline.com\, your c
 ommunity directory and local news hub for Bloomington and Monroe County.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T212653Z
LOCATION:Upland Brewing Co. Brewpub\, 350 W 11th St\, Bloomington\, IN 474
 04
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonOnline Food & Drink
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_bloomington_in_gov_1rosks8nont4ebaq41tfgg8v7g_group_calendar_google_com
SUMMARY:Community Zoo by You
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270112T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270112T173000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052101Z
UID:0lksoggjifjuqqps6dtbn61too@google.com__20270112
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20250924T212003Z
DESCRIPTION:Earn honorary Zookeeper status by creating animal crafts with 
 us!\n\nCalling all animal lovers!  Learn about different exotic animals t
 hrough crafts\, games and other fun activities. Earn your honorary Zookeep
 er status when you attend multiple events in the series! \n\nParticipation
  fee $3 per person each event. Pre-registration not required. Meet at the 
 Bosque in Switchyard Park\, located east of the Switchyard Park Pavilion.\
 n\nCommunity Zoo by You is held the second Tuesday of the month\, April th
 rough October.\n\nThis event is for families with young children and schoo
 l-aged children. The cost is $3/participant\, admission is paid only at th
 e event. If someone offers you a ticket\, it is a scam!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T195727Z
LOCATION:Switchyard Park\, 1601 S Rogers St\, Bloomington\, IN 47403\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Parks and Recreation
END:VEVENT
