 g>.  </p><p>Crafting with humans!  Bring your supplies and craft with u
 s.  All ages welcome\, free event\, no purchase required.  All craft are
  welcome\, just avoid anything with fumes or loud noises.  Coloring books
  available if your craft is on a time out. Bring your own snacks &amp\; d
 rinks or order delivery if you're hungry.  Indoor and outdoor seating ava
 ilable\, weather permitting. </p><p><a href="https://rebelpurl.com/pages/
