 w she does it all!). She is based in NYC but performs standup literally al
 l over the world. She headlined as part of New York Comedy Festival\, 2024
  and 2025. Her sarcastic\, dark comedy and incessant posting have amassed 
 her a following of over 500k across platforms. Her goofy little internet v
 ideos have been featured by Buzzfeed\, Betches\, New Yorkers\, and Barstoo
 l. She is also the co-creator and star of Run Club: The Web Series. Instag
 ram @yvettesegan\; TikTok @yevit.
