 nday rides feature lower mileage (19-24 miles) and slower paces than Satur
 day touring rides.  They use Bloomington area low traffic roads.<br><br>N
 on-members should\, prior to participation\, sign up for a <a href="https:
 //secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=137889" target="
