UID:fc8a7ulkn1n5cbdi9a7llqcisl@google.com__20270126
SEQUENCE:13
CREATED:20240503T200305Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u>If no ride is listed\, then riders should feel free to 
 choose a suitable route.<br><br><span>This group emphasizes earlier\, mode
 rate-paced rides with routes planned in advance and posted on the ride cal
 endar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.  Expect an ove
 rall average moving speed of 12 - 15 mph.  Distances vary from 20 to a li
 ttle over 30 miles.  Early season rides will be at the lower end of the d
 istance scale.  During colder weather the ride departs at 1:00pm.  </sp
 an><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getme
 registered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free t
 rial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elec
 tronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br><b
 r><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T144257Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Parking Lot\, S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\
 , USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
END:VEVENT
