SUMMARY: The Cottage
DESCRIPTION:Constellation Stage & Screen presents “The Cottage ” on stage
  May 13th- May 30th at the Waldron Auditorium.\n\nWhen Sylvia decides to 
 expose her latest affair to her husband—and her lover’s wife—an idyllic E
 nglish countryside getaway turns into a wildly improper disaster. As love
 rs and spouses collide under one roof\, what begins as a scandal quickly 
 spirals into a cascade of outrageous twists\, romantic entanglements\, an
 d deliciously bad decisions. From the writer of the smash-hit stage adapt
 ation of Clue\, The Cottage is a fast-paced farce that delivers big laugh
 s\, bold antics\, and a giant dose of high-society mischief.\n\nSee Const
 ellation’s website for more information\, including a detailed performanc
 e schedule. Learn more and find tickets at seeconstellation.org/mainstage
 /the-cottage/ https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/the-cottage/\n\n
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Live,Theatre
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/62fb9509b27fd5
 06428328ed/6a1f1fa79301fa25d83a1dfc/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Constellation Stage & Screen presents “The Cottage ”
  on stage May 13th- May 30th at the Waldron Auditorium. When Sylvia decid
 es to expose her latest affair to...
LOCATION:Waldron Arts Center\,122 South Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN 
 47404\, USA
